        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nina Davuluri\n- Roles: public speaker, advocate, host, Miss America 2014\n- Products: “Made In America”\n- Organizations: Zee TV America\n- Concepts: Indian Americans, Americans of Indian ancestry\n\nFacts:\n- Nina Davuluri was born on April 20, 1989.\n- Nina Davuluri is an American public speaker and advocate.\n- Nina Davuluri is the host of the reality show “Made In America” on Zee TV America.\n- As Miss America 2014, Nina Davuluri became the first contestant of Indian descent to win the Miss America Competition.\n- As Miss America 2014, Nina Davuluri was also the second Asian American winner.\n- Indian Americans, or Indo-Americans, are Americans whose ancestry belongs to any of the many ethnic groups of the Republic of India.",
